      "statusChangeNewStatus": "needs more information",
      "value": "Hello, there isn't enough information in this report to be able to investigate this issue. Please can you provide more information about the problem such as how your constraint is set up and how the World transform shown in your video clip is moving? If ticking Solve In Local Space makes a difference, that might mean you World transform is rotating relative to its parent.\n\nAre you able to share the ID of an avatar that shows a difference in behavior compared to Unity constraints?",
